          </p>
          <ol>
            <li>Measuring real anonymized session traces with reference BPE tokenizers (<code>o200k_base</code> / <code>cl100k_base</code>).</li>
            <li>Controlled A/B experiments with feature-flagged mechanisms (≥ 30 tasks per arm, fixed model, bootstrap confidence intervals) tracking billed tokens, pass rate, and p50/p95 latency.</li>
            <li>Foundational references: Weiser (1981, Program Slicing), Myers (1986, O(ND) Difference Algorithm), Wald (1945, SPRT), Dorfman (1943, Group Testing), and the 12 verified arXiv citations in Paper 1.</li>
          </ol>
        </section>
